<div class="s-faq" data-plr-component="s-faq">
  <div class="u-container">
    <div class="s__header">
      <h2 class="s__title t-h-sm">FAQs</h2>
      <div class="s__line"></div>
      <p class="s__intro">
        Find answers to common questions about our B2B courses, bootcamps,
        training programs, and more.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="s__questions">
      <div class="sb-question js-question">
        <h3 class="sb__question">
          <span
            class="a-bullet-point a-bullet-point--outline a-bullet-point--blue"
          ></span>

          What type of courses do you give?
        </h3>
        <div class="sb__inner js-inner">
          <div class="sb__answer t-t-sm rte js-answer">
            Right now, our Generative AI and Prompting courses are the most
            popular. We also teach Python, SQL, Data Visualization, Data
            Analytics, BI tools, and more. Our courses normally include modules
            on how to use Generative AI to get most out of SQL for example.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__icon">
          <div class="sb__icon__line"></div>
          <div class="sb__icon__line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sb-question js-question">
        <h3 class="sb__question">
          <span
            class="a-bullet-point a-bullet-point--outline a-bullet-point--blue"
          ></span>

          What’s the benefit of tailor-made courses?
        </h3>
        <div class="sb__inner js-inner">
          <div class="sb__answer t-t-sm rte js-answer">
            We don’t build courses for the sake of teaching technology; we
            create courses that are relevant to your particular business. We are
            dedicated to upskilling your team with practical skills they will
            use upon finishing the course, helping your business overcome real
            challenges.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__icon">
          <div class="sb__icon__line"></div>
          <div class="sb__icon__line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sb-question js-question">
        <h3 class="sb__question">
          <span
            class="a-bullet-point a-bullet-point--outline a-bullet-point--blue"
          ></span>

          Are all courses tailor-made?
        </h3>
        <div class="sb__inner js-inner">
          <div class="sb__answer t-t-sm rte js-answer">
            No, we also offer a broad range of pre-packaged courses. You can
            choose the level of customization and duration yourself.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sb__icon">
          <div class="sb__icon__line"></div>
          <div class="sb__icon__line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
